SnippetSearchRequest.description:
Inputs for the snippet-search agent. Snippet search is workspace-scoped;
application_id is not supported (no backing column in the search index).
Passing application_id or other unknown fields will result in a 400 error.

steps_truncated.description:
True when `steps` was truncated to fit the per-flow budget. Present only
when steps is present (include_details=true and the flow was search-surfaced);
a flow whose step content is unavailable carries neither field.
